                                                "example_id": "c19cdca9-19d3-4ea1-a1a0-003168a8f1a4",
                                                "sense_id": "56088500-5c28-3560-b653-da31e26bda74",
                                                "text": "Many of the legitimate nightclubs of today sprang like legalized phoenixes from the still-hot ashes of the speakeasies of prohibition days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65734e83-2920-4954-9373-471f7e763343",
                                                "sense_id": "56088500-5c28-3560-b653-da31e26bda74",
                                                "text": "Retuning^([sic]) to Gotham, he came to intimately know Manhattan's speakeasy scene. “At a speakeasy,” Hirschfeld acknowledged, “you had to be known to get in...each place had its own clientele.” Membership cards, really fake IDs, were common."
                                            }
